    "A SABL file is an archive used by Activision Call of Duty: Black Ops II, the ninth installment in the Call of Duty first-person shooter franchise. It contains multiple audio files saved in the Waveform Audio File Format (WAV) format, and is used for sound effects in the game. Most Call of Duty: Black Ops II gamers will not come across a SABL file. However, gamers looking to modify sound effects in the game can alter SABL files. You can open SABL files in Black Ops II Sound Studio. SABL files can be found in the following directory of Call of Duty: Black Ops II in Windows: Steam/​steamapps/​common/​Call of Duty Black Ops II/​sound. Windows Black Ops II Sound Studio. Activision Call of Duty: Black Ops II.",
