    ".ZAB",
    "Zipped Audio Book",
    "3.9",
    "Compressed audiobook unzipped by ZIP programs, such as WinZip and Pacifist; contains recorded audio for a book, which enables you to listen to the book; stored in the compressed ZIP format in order to transfer large audio files. NOTE: In order to play the audio from the ZAB file, you must unzip the file using one of the listed applications below. Windows Corel WinZip. VideoLAN VLC media player. Mac CharlesSoft Pacifist. MacItBetter BetterZip. VideoLAN VLC media player. PKZip. Linux VideoLAN VLC media playerFree.",
