    "Reason Song File",
    "3.9",
    "Song created with Reason, an audio production program that includes composition and sound design features; stores sequencer data and virtual rack settings. NOTE: RNS files are project files, rather than audio files. Therefore, they do not store audio track recordings, though they may include audio samples. Windows ReasonStudios Reason. Mac ReasonStudios Reason.",
