    "Kinetic Music Project",
    "3.7",
    "Audio project file created by Kinetic, an application for creating electronic music; stores audio loops and instrument patches on a multitrack timeline; can be exported to common audio formats (e.g.,.WAV or.MP3) and played in a standard audio player. NOTE: Cakewalk Kinetic is no longer developed and was succeeded by Cakewalk SONAR. Windows Cakewalk SONAR X3.",
    "Windows Cakewalk SONAR X3.",
