    "Music file saved in Sonys proprietary ATRAC (Adaptive Transform Acoustic Coding) format; may contain DRM copy protection to prevent the file from being played on unauthorized computers or devices. OMA files were used for distributing music through the Sony CONNECT Music Store, which was discontinued in March 2008. Windows File Viewer Plus. Sony SonicStage —  (Discontinued). VideoLAN VLC media player. Mac VideoLAN VLC media player. Macgo Mac Media Player. Linux VideoLAN VLC media playerFree.",
