    ".EFQ",
    "Ensoniq SQ1/SQ2/KS-32 File",
    "3.0",
    "Sound format used by the SQ1, SQ2, and KS-32 synthesizers, a line of digital workstation keyboards released by Ensoniq in the early 1990s. Windows Chicken Systems Translator. Mac Chicken Systems Translator.",
