    "Adlib Tracker II Instrument File",
    "2.5",
    "File created by Adlib Tracker II, an 18 channel FM audio tracking application; contains instrument samples accessed by Adlib Tracker II to create compositions. NOTE: The original Adlib Tracker instrument file has the.INS extension. Windows Adlib Tracker IIFree.",
