    ".NKB",
    "Kontakt Audio Bank",
    "2.5",
    "Audio file used by Kontakt, an audio sampling application; contains a library, or bank, of audio samples and instruments that can be imported and used by the program; enables custom sounds to be shared and sold by third party vendors. Windows Native Instruments Kontakt. Mac Native Instruments Kontakt.",
