    ".MSV",
    "Memory Stick Voice File",
    "1.7",
    "Compressed audio file format used by Sonys Memory Stick IC recorders, such as the ICD-MS1 and ICD-MS515; similar to a Sony Digital Voice (.DVF) file, but not as common; can be opened with Sonys Digital Voice Player. Windows Sony Digital Voice Player. Microsoft Windows Media Player with Sony Player plugin Included with OS.",
