    ".MWS",
    "MWave DSP Synth Instrument Extract",
    "1.0",
    "Worksheet created with Maple 8.x or earlier, a mathematics and modeling program; may include text, math equations, graphs, charts, and other data; saved in an interactive format that can be opened and edited with Maple. NOTE: Maple 9 and later saves worksheets in a new XML-based format with an.MW file extension. Windows Maplesoft Maple. Mac Maplesoft Maple. Linux Maplesoft Maple. Text data file exported by an IBM MWave DSP synthesizer when saving a file in the MWS format; created by the MWSYNTH.INI file, which constructs instruments from.WAV files. Windows Edit with any text editor Mac Edit with any text editor.",
